SEAM-PLACEHOLDER: Stučka knowledge-base distribution GPG public key (independent subkey).

This is NOT a real key. The KB distribution subkey is independent of the application upgrade
master key (deploy/04 §4.4.3) and rotates yearly. Replace this file via:

    gpg --armor --export <kb-subkey-id> > keys/stuchka-kb-pubkey.asc
    cp keys/stuchka-kb-pubkey.asc installer/redist/

The KB GPG-verify path is implemented for real in crates/kb (gpg::verify_detached) and
scripts/kb/verify_gpg.sh; scripts/kb/selftest_gpg.sh proves it accepts a good signature and
rejects a tampered package using a runtime throwaway key. The production subkey is a seam.

Fingerprint (publish in README + app About page once the real key exists): XXXX YYYY ZZZZ ...
